      "writtenOn": "2024-06-17T05:48:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To be precise, we are not building upstream tests for `bloonchipper`. [bloonchipper](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/fpmcu/BUILD.py) is a project/program based on the [google_dragonclaw](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/tree/main/boards/google/dragonclaw) board/platform. The upstream test uses the `google_dragonclaw` board and its config/dts files. When building outside chroot within Zephyr repo, the additional `CONFIG_FPU\u003dy` config is not required, because builtins are built without using floating-point instructions.\n\nSo, I think we have to add it here since it is chroot specific thing.",
      "parentUuid": "8619ee60_f649c1d0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 861,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 861,
        "endChar": 34
